{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/2026/0529/c63837a3168032/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:29.041800+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/2026/0529/c63837a3168032/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>浙江大学</span><a href=\"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/main.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>生物医学工程与仪器科学学院</span></a></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>以下简称生仪学院</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>将于</span></span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span>日（具体日程见</span><span><span>入营联系群</span></span><span>）举办</span></span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>年</span><span><span>全国</span></span><span>优秀大学生</span><span><span>暑期学术</span></span><span>夏令营。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本次活动旨在促进</span><span><span>全国</span></span><span>优秀大学生间的交流互动，</span><span><span>增进优秀大学生</span></span><span>进一步认识浙大、了解浙大，对</span><span><span>生仪学院及相关学科</span></span><span>的全面了解，为德才兼备、基础扎实、热爱科研、热爱本学科的优秀</span><span><span>大</span></span><span>学生搭建</span><span><strong><span>继续深造</span></strong></span><span>平台。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>夏令营期间，我院将</span><span><span>举办</span></span><span>学科专业介绍、学术讲座、研究生招生政策解读、实验室参观以及</span><span><span>导师交流</span></span><span>等</span><span><span>多项</span></span><span>活动。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>欢迎预期能取得母校校外推免资格且有强烈意愿就读我院直博生的同学报名。夏令营</span></span><span>报名工作自即日开始，</span><span><span>到</span></span></span></span><span><strong><span>6</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>月</span></strong></span><span><span><strong><span>22</span></strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span>日</span></strong></span><span><span><strong><span>结束</span></strong></span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>一、专业</span></strong></span><span><span><strong><span>介绍</span></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/5e4e611596cd84816795.png\"/></p><p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong><br/></p><p><span>1.</span><span></span><span>拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span>.</span><span>学业成绩优秀，将于</span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月毕业。</span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span>.</span><span>具有浓厚的科学研究兴趣，有志于本学院专业发展，有较强或潜在的研究能力</span><span>, </span><span>并有继续深造意向。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>三、报名方式</span></strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span><span>网上报名：</span><span><span>自即日起至</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span>日</span><span>12:00</span><span><span><span>前在“浙江大学研究生招生服务系统”</span><span></span><span>注册后登录进行报名完成。网址：</span></span></span></p><p><span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login</span></p><p><span>（建议使用</span><span>IE8.0</span><span>以上版本浏览器或者</span><span>Google Chrome</span><span>浏览器）</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span><span>材料递交：</span><span><strong><span>无需邮寄纸质材料。</span></strong></span><span>按网上报名系统要求，将相关材料（首页个人简介，以及体现自身学术水平和工作能力等材料，制作成一个</span></span></span><span>PDF</span><span><span><span>文件，</span><span><span>全部页面</span></span><span>不超过</span></span></span><span>10</span><span>页）上传至报名网址中的“成绩单附件栏”，材料明细如下：</span></p><p><span> ①</span><span>个人简介（</span><span>1</span><span>页）</span></p><p><span> ②</span><span>本科成绩单和本专业年级排名（注明专业总人数和排名）各</span><span>1</span><span>份，须加盖教务处或院系公章；</span></p><p><span> ③</span><span>其它材料（如：英语等级证书、发表论文首页、各类获奖或资格证书等材料，不超过</span><span>5</span><span>个）；</span></p><p><span> ④</span><span>至少一位任课老师的推荐信，须有推荐人手写签字或电子签名；</span></p><p><span> ⑤</span><span>自我陈述（感兴趣的研究方向</span><span>/</span><span>研究目标，</span><span>1000</span><span>字以内）。</span></p><p><span><span><span>申请者应保证所有信息及提交材料的真实性、有效性和完整性，由</span><span><strong><span>材料不实</span></strong></span><span>造成的后果由本人自负。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>注意事项：建议填写意向导师，便于后续审核和选拔。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>四、审核</span></strong></span><span><span><strong><span>和选拔</span></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>学院将根据申请者提交的材料，以申请者的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质等为主要评价依据，由学科专家组对申请者进行入围资格审查。</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span><span>日前，学院在报名系统中录入审核结果，并通知本人（以电子邮件形式）</span><span><span>。</span></span><span>入选同学需在</span></span></span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>29</span></span><span>日上午</span><span>10</span><span>点前确认是否参加，逾期未确认视放弃此资格。</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>30</span></span><span>日后未接到入选通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>五、行程安排</span></strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>学院暑期夏令营暂定于</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>日举行（</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>日下午报到），为期三天。夏令营将组织学术讲座、考察参观及</span><span><span>导师</span></span><span>交流，详情届时请见夏令营活动安排。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>六、</span></strong></span><span><span><strong><span>其他</span></strong></span></span><span><strong><span>事项</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span>.</span><span>学院不统一安排住宿。营员的食宿、交通费用需自理。</span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span>.</span><span><span>参加暑期夏令营的学生必须遵守浙江大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加活动，并注意安全。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/2026/0529/c63837a3168032/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>3</span></span><span>.</span><span><span><span>营员报到后要求全程参加夏令营活动，</span><span><span>不得</span></span><span>擅自离营。</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>七、联系方式：</span></strong></span></p><p><span>地址：浙江省杭州市浙大路</span><span>38</span><span>号浙江大学生仪学院</span><span>211</span><span>室</span></p><p><span>邮编：</span><span>310027</span></p><p><span>联系人：黄老师</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>huacow@zju.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>电话：</span><span>0571-87951585</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>生仪学院</span></p><p><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span>5</span><span>月</span></p><p><span><span>相关链接：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span>学院介绍</span><span><a href=\"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/</span></a></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span>招生导师目录（个别导师变更以浙江大学研招办公布招生简章为准）</span><span><a href=\"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/dsml_65451/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/dsml_65451/list.htm</span></a></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>学院往年招生相关通知</span><span><a href=\"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/tzgg_65358/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/tzgg_65358/list.htm</span></a></span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><a href=\"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/67/95/1bbca3564a27b3e9f6195a63f376/3b860bc1-a798-45ec-86d5-9ece89496d86.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>研究生招生管理系统夏令营模块学生操作手册(最新).docx</span></a></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"566c61d50761881f6f82633bda416d9d1c48d1eed178764a03ba8e407089a186","textLength":1520,"sourceSha256":"41125840769682720c992df276651c0b7971c9913af567309e81ced49b746aea","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-56e566496aae16f2d185","title":"2026年浙江大学生物医学工程与仪器科学学院2026年全国优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:29.041800+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/67/95/1bbca3564a27b3e9f6195a63f376/516320f2-b598-478d-b8c2-ebba69860189.png","file":"assets/articles/media/5e4e611596cd84816795.png"}]}
